 <text>
  <body>
   <p><date when="1861-02-25">25</date> 
<lb/>The <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">Governor</persName> approved an account of $43.<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">25</hi></hi> to Steamboat <orgName ref="cwgk:O00021516">Dove</orgName> for freight bill on Arms. certified as correct by the <persName ref="cwgk:N00002598">Q<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> M<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> General</persName></p>
<p>He appointed <persName ref="cwgk:N00002370">T. A Franklin</persName> a Justice of the Peace in and for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000938">Grant County</placeName> District N<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">o</hi></hi> 4. vice <persName ref="cwgk:N00002298">J. T. Elliston</persName></p>
<p>He respited the following Judgments for twelve months</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000363">Caldwell Cir. Ct.</orgName> vs. <persName ref="cwgk:N00010696">Jesse Williams</persName></cell>
	<cell>3 Judg<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">t</hi></hi> each $100.</cell>
	<cell>Forfeiture</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>" " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00010694">Ja<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> Williams</persName></cell>
	<cell>$185</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>" " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00010695">Jno Williams</persName></cell>
	<cell>2 Judgts each $500. &amp; 1 of $25.</cell>
	<cell/>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>" " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00010693">W H. Calvert</persName> Adm<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> &amp; others</cell>
	<cell>$4000.</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>" " " " W. H. Calvert "</cell>
	<cell>$500.</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
</table><pb/></p>
<p><note place="header">179</note></p>
<p><date when="1861">1861</date> Executive Journal</p>
<p><date when="1861-02-25">Feby. 25</date>. 
<lb/>The Governor remitted the following Judgments, to wit:</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000626">Graves E &amp; C. C<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">t</hi></hi></orgName> vs. <persName ref="cwgk:N00021564">Cargill</persName> &amp; <persName ref="cwgk:N00021565">Morris</persName></cell>
	<cell>$100.</cell>
	<cell>Forfeiture</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000617">Daviess</orgName> " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021567">M. Smithheimer</persName></cell>
	<cell>$200.</cell>
	<cell>Gaming</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000664">M<hi rend="sup">c</hi>Cracken</orgName> " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00002051">Jno. Q. A. King</persName></cell>
	<cell>$100</cell>
	<cell>Forfeiture</cell>
</row>
</table></p>
<p>He respited two Judgments of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000609">Carroll County Court</orgName> one of fifteen the other of five days imprisonmnet against <persName ref="cwgk:N00021566">Sam<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">l</hi></hi> Wilson</persName>.</p>
  </body>
